flowchart TD
    A([Start reading session]) --> B[Identify book - RFID scan planned]
    B --> C[Load book manifest and validate checkpoints]
    C --> D[Sort by checkpoint_position]
    D --> E[Set next expected checkpoint]
    E --> F[Activate current checkpoint plus next two - planned]
    F --> G[Child reads aloud into microphone]
    G --> H[Local speech recognition produces transcript]
    H --> I[Normalize transcript and checkpoint_text]
    I --> J[Compare speech with active checkpoint phrases]
    J --> K{Clear match confirmed across consecutive updates?}
    K -- No --> G
    K -- Yes --> L[Mark any earlier unmatched checkpoints skipped - planned]
    L --> M[Record matched position and prevent repeat triggers]
    M --> N[Advance to checkpoint after the matched one]
    M --> O[Schedule only the matched checkpoint effect - planned]
    O --> P[Wait visual_delay milliseconds from confirmation]
    O --> Q[Wait sound_delay milliseconds from confirmation]
    P --> R[Play visual if present - planned]
    Q --> S[Play sound if present - planned]
    N --> T{All checkpoints triggered or skipped?}
    T -- No --> F
    T -- Yes --> U([Checkpoint sequence complete])

    classDef planned fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b8860b,color:#222;
    class B,F,L,O,P,Q,R,S planned;
